factions of Pailune maintained a tense balance.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At Kliff's side stood his steadfast Greymane comrades: Oongka, Yann, and Naira.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">That fragile peace is shattered with the sudden assault of the Black Bears. The Greymanes fall one by one in the ambush. In a desperate struggle against their fearsome leader Myurdin, Kliff and the few Greymanes who survive are scattered to the winds. Kliff, etching the names of his fallen companions into his heart, vows to rebuild the Greymanes and exact vengeance upon the Black Bears. Along this path, he would meet those who seek to upend the very order of the continent and face a mission unlike any he has ever known.</p>","developers":["Pearl Abyss"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/abd7dbdeaede8b6c9a6d40bf116ff2b883f2dd45/header.jpg?t=1767863504","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u24d2 Pearl Abyss Corp. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 135 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> macOS compatible audio device</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 26<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M4 Pro<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</